<title>USA: Interchange Financial okays shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Interchange Financial okays shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interchange Financial Services Corp said on Friday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 141,980 shares, or approximately five percent of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Repurchases are authorized to be made by the company from time to time in open-market transactions, depending upon market conditions, Interchange said.</p>
<p>Purchases are expected to begin after September 30, 1996, the company said.  The repurchased shares will be held as treasury stock and will be available for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
</text>
